ay as one of the workers during the most dangerous work in the world. Cut, hit, weld! Dismantle one of the available parts of the ship, and sell the obtained parts and upgrade your equipment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286880/extras/2da0d9103213818a7305830df6082cda.poster.avif?t=1786027680\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286880/extras/2da0d9103213818a7305830df6082cda.webm?t=1786027680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286880/extras/2da0d9103213818a7305830df6082cda.mp4?t=1786027680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore all decks of the ship for valuable items. Take advantage of the opportunity to explore the mysterious spaces hidden inside these amazing colossi.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286880/extras/556c6a6427c4d276af79286e48af972a.poster.avif?t=1786027680\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286880/extras/556c6a6427c4d276af79286e48af972a.webm?t=1786027680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286880/extras/556c6a6427c4d276af79286e48af972a.mp4?t=1786027680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The job of a worker dismantling ships is one of the most dangerous in the world. Demolition with only basic tools. If you are not afraid to get your hands dirty with oils and other substances, take the hammer in your hands and go to work, you have many ships to destroy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286880/extras/331c96d241253a242114197667ea5c0c.poster.avif?t=1786027680\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286880/extras/331c96d241253a242114197667ea5c0c.webm?t=1786027680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286880/extras/331c96d241253a242114197667ea5c0c.mp4?t=1786027680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can sell or exchange the acquired items for other items.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286880/extras/342f7b9016521fc44a82f39ceb7c4713.poster.avif?t=1786027680\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286880/extras/342f7b9016521fc44a82f39ceb7c4713.webm?t=1786027680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286880/extras/342f7b9016521fc44a82f39ceb7c4713.mp4?t=1786027680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Be careful, you can have a serious accident or even die at any time","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64 Bit / Windows 8 64 Bit / Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce GTX 780<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64 Bit / Windows 8 64 Bit / Windows 10 64 Bit<b